# shellcheck shell=sh
# Configuration for /etc/init.d/netavark-dhcp-proxy
#
# Extra arguments for `netavark dhcp-proxy`.
#
# Note that `-a <seconds>` (activity timeout) is intentionally NOT set by
# default. It exists so systemd can let an idle proxy exit and socket-activate
# it again on demand; OpenRC has no socket activation, so a timeout here would
# stop the proxy permanently.
#netavark_dhcp_proxy_opts=""
